  "instructions": [
    "Grind the soaked idli rice and urad dal into a smooth batter.",
    "Add chopped green chilli, smoked paprika, and salt to the batter and mix well.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a small pan and add the batter to it.",
    "Steam the idli in a steamer for 15 minutes.",
    "Poach the idli in boiling water for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve the idli hot with chopped fresh cilantro on top.",
    "Garnish with additional smoked paprika if desired.",
    "Serve with a side of low-carb chutney or sauce.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze the leftover idli for later use."
